    "md5": "b8958606f55ad5a6840645c72768c761",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 971,
    "chunk_text": "He said the Government\u2019s actions were intended to send a clear message that anyone who misappropriates public funds would eventually be held accountable.\n\n\u201cWe are doing this to set an example to the people of our country, proving that anyone who touches even a single cent of public wealth will face punishment one day,\u201d he said.\n\n\u201cWe harbor no hatred toward anyone. What we hold is a vision to rebuild this country,\u201d he said.\n\nHe said the people had placed their trust in the Government with expectations that corruption would be eliminated, the rule of law restored, the economy developed and a better future created for their children.\n\nAccording to the President, those objectives could not be achieved without taking action against corruption and ensuring that those responsible for wrongdoing face the law.\n\n\u201cStopping theft, putting an end to corruption, and making the law fair and civilized for everyone are vital parts of nation-building,\u201d he said."
