    "description": "\u201cNPP government attempting to capture the judiciary and 88/89 era will repeat again\u201d - Archuna",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/NPP-government-attempting-to-capture-the-judiciary-and-8889-era-will-repeat-again-Archuna/108-350158",
    "lang": "en",
