    "chunk_size_bytes": 559,
    "chunk_text": "Severe lightning advisory issued for several areas\n\nColombo, September 13 (Daily Mirror)- The Department of Meteorology issued an advisory for severe lightning for Eastern, Uva, North-Central, Central and Sabaragamuwa provinces and in Vavuniya, Mannar, Mullaittivu and Kurunegala districts.\n\nThe Department said thundershowers likely to occur at several places in these area.\n\nIt said there may be temporary localized strong winds during thundershowers.\n\nGeneral public is advised to take adequate precautions to minimize damages caused by lightning activity."
  },
