    "md5": "a2a50b24604869dea1e10faa1b7b1d79",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 595,
    "chunk_text": "Dense fog causes traffic disruptions in Central Hills\n\nColombo, September 13 (Daily Mirror)- Traffic disruptions have been reported along the western slopes of the Central Hills due to dense fog that has persisted since the early hours of today (13).\n\nThe fog has significantly reduced visibility along the Hatton\u2013Nuwara Eliya and Hatton\u2013Colombo main roads, as well as several surrounding by-roads.\n\nHatton Police have urged motorists travelling in the affected areas to exercise caution, reduce their speed and keep their headlights switched on to ensure greater visibility and road safety."
  },
